# SparkOS: Homebrew's update timers stay off until someone sets Homebrew up.
# Bazzite's 01-homebrew.preset turns them on at first boot, so they'd contact GitHub every day
# on a PC that never uses Homebrew. Systemd reads presets in name order and the first line that
# matches wins, so this file (00-) comes before Bazzite's (01-).
# `sparkos-dev-setup --brew` turns them on (after asking for the password) once Homebrew is in use.
# brew-setup.service stays on: it only unpacks the Homebrew that ships in the image, offline.
disable brew-update.timer
disable brew-upgrade.timer
